# The scenes of the replacing-hard-wired-dependencies deck, in order. Each "## Scene N: title" is one slide, spoken with item N of
# replacing-hard-wired-dependencies.narration.md. Each line under a heading puts one thing on the slide:
#   note "<text>"         a line of text
#   show <file> ...       a code panel: <from> <to> or /pattern/, then a label; --mark and --zoom mark lines
#   run_live "<command>"  a live run, played from its cast in replacing-hard-wired-dependencies.outputs/
#   callout "<text>"      a boxed sentence saying what a result means

## Scene 1: step 1, the version catalogue
note "Step 1: add Mockito to the version catalogue."
show libs.versions.toml "/mockito/" gradle/libs.versions.toml

## Scene 2: step 2, the test dependency
note "Step 2: add it as a test dependency of the lesson."
show lessons/replacing-hard-wired-dependencies/example/build.gradle.kts "/^dependencies/" "lesson build file" --zoom 9

## Scene 3: the code under test
note "The code under test: today's invoice. It gets the exchange rate from a *hard-wired* singleton."
show TodaysInvoice 9 17 "today's invoice" --zoom 15

## Scene 4: the test
note "The test hands over *stand-in* rates, made by Mockito: always 1.17 euros to the pound."
show InvoiceTest 13 33 "the test" --zoom 20

## Scene 5: today's invoice can't be tested
note "Run the test against today's invoice:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:replacing-hard-wired-dependencies:test -Pcode=today"
callout "Today's invoice has nowhere to take the stand-in, so it calls the live service, and the test can't run."

## Scene 6: the rates passed in
note "The invoice after one small change: the rates are *passed in* through the constructor."
show Invoice.java 9 24 "the invoice, rates passed in" --zoom 14-16

## Scene 7: the test runs
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:replacing-hard-wired-dependencies:test"
callout "Same test, same stand-in: now it runs in a second, with no network and no account."
